2026-04-02 12:10:03,211[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-aa878d5e832438e1] execute_python_code({"code": "def count_rook_tours(n):\n    if n == 1:\n        return 1\n    else:\n        # Initialize the DP table\n        dp = [[0] * (3 * n) for _ in range(3)]\n        dp[0][0] = 1  # Start at (1,1)\n\n        for i in range(1, 3 * n):\n            dp[0][i] = dp[0][i-1]  # Move right\n            if i >= 3:\n                dp[0][i] += dp[1][i-3]\n            if i >= 6:\n                dp[0][i] += dp[2][i-6]\n\n        for j in range(1, 3):\n            for i in range(1, 3 * n):\n                dp[j][i] = dp[j][i-1]  # Move up\n                if i >= 3:\n                    dp[j][i] += dp[(j-1) % 3][i-3]\n                if i >= 6:\n                    dp[j][i] += dp[(j+1) % 3][i-6]\n\n        return dp[0][-1]\n\nn = 5\nresult = count_rook_tours(n)", "timeout": 30}) - MainThread
