2026-04-02 13:01:52,838[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-81ec5d0c12f5c87c] execute_python_code({"code": "def min_non_empty_piles(n):\n    # Start with n piles, each containing 1 pebble\n    piles = [1] * n\n\n    # Perform moves until only one non-empty pile remains\n    while len(piles) > 1:\n        # Find two non-empty piles with the same number of pebbles\n        i = 0\n        while piles[i] == 0:\n            i += 1\n        j = i + 1\n        while j < len(piles) and piles[j] != piles[i]:\n            j += 1\n\n        # If found, perform the move\n        if j < len(piles):\n            new_pile = piles[i]\n            piles[i] -= new_pile\n            piles[j] -= new_pile\n            piles.append(new_pile)\n\n    return len(piles)\n\n# Starting with 8 piles\nn = 8\nmin_non_empty_piles_result = min_non_empty_piles(n)\nmin_non_empty_piles_result", "timeout": 30}) - MainThread
